            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "dave"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I took this recipe and sub stunted cocktail sauce for the bleu cheese dressing and used cooked shrimp (cut them in half long ways). One shrimp (two pieces) covers one slice of cocktail rye. You may want to adjust the cream cheese/cocktail sauce ratio. I also will try the original recipe and may add crumbled bleu cheese, too.",
