            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ExMilitaryWife"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good recipes. I chopped up the cucumber and olives and mixed them in with the cream cheese. At first I tried to make this without the blue dressing(I normally make my own but didn't feel like making any this time) but the dip did need it, so I added some blue cheese salad dressing and that made it taste better.",
            "datePublished": "2011-02-11T18:08:44.447Z"
